  "contracts": [
    "INT 21h AX=3306h returns BX=1606h and DX=1000h only when resident in HMA; LOW and HIGH without HIMEM return DX=0. ES is preserved.",
    "Guest DPB must match sector size, cluster size, reserved sectors, FAT count/size, root entries/location, first data sector and maximum cluster. Guest reads known bytes and writes a file verified independently by host mtools.",
    "FAT12/FAT16; 16/32-bit totals; shorter-than-partition volumes; original mtools, DOS, blank and custom OEM names; nondefault reserved sectors, FAT count and root size.",
    "Malformed BPBs fall back without importing invalid fields: signature, sector size, cluster size, reserved/FAT/root fields, FAT capacity, metadata overflow and volume bounds."
  ],
